{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今晚（27日）播出的TVB節目《試真 D 唷》，主持江美儀、吳業坤及曾展望GM到高雄夜市掃街，GM竟忽然張家輝上身大跳「自 High 舞」挑機美儀姐，場面爆笑！但最令人意想不到的是，身為美食家的美儀姐竟老貓燒鬚，在美食挑戰中將煙燻味誤認為「雪櫃味」，究竟她發生了甚麼失誤？</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/10_2728822216ab887f7e6db7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>GM夜市突張家輝上身 亢奮挑機江美儀</p><p>在高雄夜市掃街挑戰期間，主持曾展望GM將其佻皮本色發揮得淋漓盡致。在排隊等候福建炒麵時，GM見識到店主的拋鑊絕技，竟無厘頭高歌《皆大歡喜》經典歌詞：「Hey 呀 Hey 呀 Hey，Hey 呀 Hey呀 Hey」，即時引來江美儀反眼。到試食環節，GM更因食到超美味糯米糍而興奮得張家輝上身，大跳「自 High 舞」，並亢奮地向美儀姐挑機：「Who 怕 who」，成功令平時做開「訓導主任」的美儀姐也忍不住捧腹大笑。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20_18640949546ab88819429cd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/21_21468519466ab8881c88b9f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>江美儀美食家老貓燒鬚 煙燻雞腳慘變雪櫃味</p><p>雖然GM行為輕佻，但真正出事的卻是美食家江美儀。在品嚐評價極高的煙燻無骨雞腳凍時，美儀姐竟連環失手，將獨特的煙燻味誤認為「雪櫃味」，隨即遭到GM及吳業坤輪流攻擊。坤哥首先發難：「你雪櫃煙燻味呀美儀姐？」美儀姐搞笑地強撐：「好貴呀我雪櫃」，GM則在旁補刀：「我哋呢啲平民。」三人互動火花四濺，場面極之搞笑。</p><p>網民笑爆美儀姐反差萌 「GM太好笑」</p><p>節目播出後，網民對主持間的化學作用反應熱烈，紛紛留言大讚好笑。不少網民指江美儀的反差萌非常可愛：「美儀姐平時咁精明，估唔到會搞錯雪櫃味，好有反差萌！」、「睇到美儀姐話自己個雪櫃好貴，笑到肚痛！」亦有網民大讚GM的綜藝感：「GM真係好鬼好笑，成日激嬲美儀姐，但又好有火花！」、「呢三個人組合好正，希望有多啲佢哋一齊嘅畫面！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/03_1986874416ab887dbd2d79.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/04_607788976ab887dfe4f1c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/05_6319480186ab887e3269cf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/06_21051996576ab887e8077f5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/07_12183513746ab887ec00abc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/08_8082709306ab887f16845c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/09_2562719156ab887f4aff57.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/11_15639832576ab887fbbdd0d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/12_20824401206ab887ff78c27.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/13_14735207896ab8880338692.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14_570907966ab88805df40b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/15_2334416746ab8880914b12.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/16_1306620926ab8880c7041e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17_12694610726ab8880fe6c4f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/18_17985884796ab8881349a1e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/19_9754158686ab8881640dae.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/22_14218179156ab8881fa1032.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/23_5096916506ab8882301166.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/24_5600050356ab8882649dfa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/25_4847354976ab8882a02d85.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/26_14570148516ab8882e3f40e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T21:37:55.341890+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":980,"images":24,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}